- decided_at: 2026-09-20T15:40:34+00:00
  event: initial
  value: Use native asynchronous child Runner tasks with isolated context, shared workspace, structured lifecycle tools, max 3 concurrent children, and max depth 2; ask/read-only children cannot mutate.
  reason: Native orchestration reuses the harness and yields structured results/cancellation; subprocess agents lost coordination, while synchronous delegation prevented useful parallel work.
